# The built-in clock takes no binding, and reads each Pump's Clock reading.
> :grant time clock now
! bad arguments
> :grant time clock
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> on reading
|   ask time to now
|   say it
| end reading
> reading
2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> on later
|   wait 5 s
|   reading
| end later
> send later to session
> :clock advance 5 s
[session/r3] 2026-09-30T10:00:05Z
